@seguir_bajada
on-arrival: moral_columnas += 3; unity += 1

The meeting ends without a decision, which is itself a decision. The columns hold; the mountain keeps its own; the war goes on being fought the way it is being fought. Perhaps the next operation turns it. Perhaps the Colonel's map completes itself first. Everyone walks back into the dark they came from, and the arithmetic waits, patient, for the next time the commanders gather.

- @post_event: Continuar.
